globals.description:
This switches between the current view of a Doc and a specified alternate layout view.
The current view of the Doc is stored in the layout_default field so that it can be restored.
If the current view of the Doc is already the specified alternate layout, this will switch
back to the original layout (stored in layout_default)
@param detailLayoutKeySuffix the name of the alternate layout field key (NOTE: 'layout_' will be prepended to this string to get the actual field name)
@param addInSidebar opens the toggled view in a sidebar tab without changing the current view

